1. Step Identification  
Step `S1` for run `trampoline_roi_ransac_20260203T000000Z_a1b2c3d`: replace 3-point trampoline frame with 4-point ROI + RANSAC plane fit and update camera→trampoline transforms.

2. Summary of Work  
- **4-point ROI click handling replaces 3-point frame**: `app/depth_region.h:45-79` shows ROI corner collection (4 clicks), auto reset on 5th click, and no 3-point P1/P2/P3 logic.
```cpp
// app/depth_region.h:45-79
if (roi_points_.size() >= 4) { ResetRoiSelection(); }
roi_points_.push_back(point_);
click_count_ = static_cast<int>(roi_points_.size());
if (roi_points_.size() == 4) { pending_roi_finalize_ = true; }
```
- **RANSAC + refinement on ROI samples**: `app/depth_region.h:284-360` gathers depth samples inside ROI, runs RANSAC, then refines with least-squares on inliers.
```cpp
// app/depth_region.h:335-353
bool ok = FitPlaneRansac(samples, ransac_max_iters_, ransac_inlier_thresh_mm_, inlier_idx, plane_ransac);
std::vector<cv::Point3d> inliers;
for (int idx : inlier_idx) { inliers.push_back(samples[idx]); }
if (!FitPlaneLeastSquares(inliers, plane_refined)) { return false; }
```
- **Frame axes definition (Z normal up, X long edge toward image right, Y = Z x X)**: `app/depth_region.h:1142-1196` sets Z from plane normal (flipped to “up”), selects the longest ROI edge and forces its direction toward image right, then computes Y = Z x X.
```cpp
// app/depth_region.h:1142-1196
cv::Vec3d Z_vec(plane[0], plane[1], plane[2]);
if (Z_vec[1] > 0.0) { Z_vec = -Z_vec; }   // up
if (roi_points_[idx2].x < roi_points_[idx1].x) { std::swap(idx1, idx2); } // toward image right
cv::Vec3d X_vec(p2.x - p1.x, p2.y - p1.y, p2.z - p1.z);
cv::Vec3d Y_vec = cv::Vec3d(Z_vec).cross(X_vec);
```
- **Transforms use the new frame**: `app/depth_region.h:378-402` applies rotation/translation; `get_pose_indemind_left.cpp:427-431` uses `TransformToNewFrame`.
```cpp
// app/depth_region.h:378-402
new_coords.x = rotation_matrix_.at<double>(0, 0) * relative.x + ...
// get_pose_indemind_left.cpp:427-431
hip_info.has_new_frame = depth_region.IsCoordSystemReady();
if (hip_info.has_new_frame) {
  hip_info.new_frame_pos = depth_region.TransformToNewFrame(hip_info.camera_pos);
}
```

